<a href="https://welltica.com/category/nutrition/vitamins-and-supplements/" class="td-post-category" >Vitamins and Supplements</a><h3 class="entry-title td-module-title"><a href="https://welltica.com/a-weight-loss-supplement-sold-online-contains-a-heart-toxic-plant-that-can-kill/"  rel="bookmark" title="A weight-loss supplement sold online contains a heart-toxic plant that can kill">A weight-loss supplement sold online contains a heart-toxic plant that can kill</a></h3><div class="td-excerpt">The pills were labeled as a harmless plant root, but FDA lab tests found something very different inside the capsules.</div></div></div></div><div class="td_module_flex td_module_flex_1 td_module_wrap td-animation-stack td-cpt-post"><div class="td-module-container td-category-pos-above"><div class="td-image-container"><div class="td-module-thumb"><a href="https://welltica.com/a-blood-test-can-now-detect-early-alzheimers-changes-in-adults-as-young-as-40/"  rel="bookmark" class="td-image-wrap " title="A blood test can now detect early Alzheimer&#8217;s changes in adults as young as 40" ><span class="entry-thumb td-thumb-css" data-type="css_image" data-img-url="https://welltica.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/wellticacom-edf7137a-f9d8-471f-901f-0b005c4d813b-696x348.jpg"  ></span></a></div></div><div class="td-module-meta-info">
